  lore: {
    about: "This enemy has a higher RES to Aero DMG . The fabricated Maiden, a vessel forged by divine hands. Her birth was but a carefully orchestrated plot. Her life is but a marionette's dance upon the threads of fate. Yet, as she gazes into the designed past and yearns for the future she has longed for, the sword she wields shall cleave the very shackles of destiny. And now, she craves an End .",
    undiscovered: "The otherworldly being that slumbers atop Avinoleum, a prophecy bestowed upon the mortal realm by the Divinity.",
